WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.992
Step 1. Open the encounter.

1.2
00:00:01.992 --> 00:00:06.960
You record a medication statement in a form that your facility built with the

1.3
00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:12.622
Medication Statement question. Select the Overview tab to see the quick actions.

2.1
00:00:12.622 --> 00:00:17.296
Step 2. Open the Forms dialog. Select the Forms quick action.

2.2
00:00:17.296 --> 00:00:23.452
Care opens the Forms dialog, which lists the encounter forms that you can use.

3.1
00:00:23.452 --> 00:00:28.872
Step 3. Select the form. Enter the name of the form in the Search Forms box,

3.2
00:00:28.872 --> 00:00:32.954
then select the form with the Medication Statement question.

3.3
00:00:32.954 --> 00:00:35.631
Care opens it for the encounter.

4.1
00:00:35.631 --> 00:00:37.614
Step 4. Add the medicine.

4.2
00:00:37.614 --> 00:00:43.300
Search for the medicine in the Add Medication box; Care searches the clinical drug

4.3
00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:47.405
list. Select the medicine to add it to the question.

5.1
00:00:47.405 --> 00:00:49.706
Step 5. Complete the details.

5.2
00:00:49.706 --> 00:00:53.947
Care selects Patient as the source and Active as the status.

5.3
00:00:53.947 --> 00:00:59.674
Dosage Instructions and the start date are mandatory; leave the end date empty if

5.4
00:00:59.674 --> 00:01:20.772
the patient still takes it.

6.1
00:01:20.772 --> 00:01:24.237
Step 6. Save the form. Select Save Changes.

6.2
00:01:24.237 --> 00:01:30.368
Care shows Questionnaire submitted successfully and returns to the Overview tab of

6.3
00:01:30.368 --> 00:01:31.914
the encounter.
